Backport of llvm/llvm-project#186293, "[ObjC] Support emission of selector stubs calls instead of objc_msgSend."
(merged 2026-03-13), to swiftlang/llvm-project swift-6.4.0-RELEASE
(docs/adr/0170-xcodes-clang-abi-and-a-patched-clang.md, B-170). Calls objc_msgSend$<selector> stubs for
AArch64 Apple targets when the linker version is 811.2 or later, as Xcode 27.0's clang (linker version 1166.2) does.
Adapted: Options.td at clang/include/clang/Driver/Options.td; the driver hunk before the legacy-runtime
subscripting comment of RenderObjCOptions (upstream's context has -fobjc-direct-precondition-thunk, which
swift-6.4.0-RELEASE lacks).

